{"v":4,"catch":"打了又躲！\n擊敗可怕的武裝組織“THE MAGIC TIGERS”！","desc":"《RIOT》是TECMO於1992年發行的動作遊戲。\n擊敗“THE MAGIC TIGERS”，征服各個關卡，這些戰士裝備著特殊武器和魔法，接二連三地阻擋你。\n敵人出現在螢幕的前後，所以你需要分別射擊他們。\n成功的關鍵是沿途善用各種武器和盾牌。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-10-31","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/90afbb018a365e7ac072ebcaa48a33b4ee7e7df1501883a608b1a7e58f3ed3af.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1b038dd252ce44e26393f68cd0826f8d6d99a83aa130c8cf1ee0fc9b88be4e81.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e219424d3cc31b532c0ab7f398b296edb39ede4fd78d89c1a667c153d2bc6fe8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/80caaecbae330ba2ef05aa26fea34b504da81ebe35e044e08bbedf911ebd6298.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e4ff6a39a5d8250c6ea8f2f8025010f3db5251a9c7720149c82d255ac173b5bd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/99eafb367f872c8e00171b8016c7f0d625f2b3c76038da0a1c6f41a557f528f7.jpg"],"titleId":"0100139020770000","dlc":[]}